          },
          "761190102": {
            "id": "761190102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kuuhenki",
            "text": "~!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190103"
            ]
          },
          "761190103": {
            "id": "761190103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "...Hah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190104"
            ]
          },
          "761190104": {
            "id": "761190104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They seem to be having fun.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190105"
            ]
          },
          "761190105": {
            "id": "761190105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Greetings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190106"
            ]
          },
          "761190106": {
            "id": "761190106",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Luonnotar",
            "text": "!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190107"
            ]
          },
          "761190107": {
            "id": "761190107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Greetings to you too, Luonnotar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190108"
            ]
          },
          "761190108": {
            "id": "761190108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Playing a new game?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190109"
            ]
          },
          "761190109": {
            "id": "761190109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes. I saw people playing with their friends using cups at The Flagship, so I borrowed the idea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190110"
            ]
          },
          "761190110": {
            "id": "761190110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "They would place a gemstone under a cup, then quickly shuffle the cups atop the table.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190111"
            ]
          },
          "761190111": {
            "id": "761190111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Upon stopping, they would have the other player guess which cup the gem was under.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190112"
            ]
          },
          "761190112": {
            "id": "761190112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "The kuuhenki love the feeling of spinning about while wrapped up in cloth, so I used Miss Mage's hat as a reference and made some improvements.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190113"
            ]
          },
          "761190113": {
            "id": "761190113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's adorable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190114"
            ]
          },
          "761190114": {
            "id": "761190114",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kuuhenki",
            "text": "~!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190115"
            ]
          },
          "761190115": {
            "id": "761190115",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait. So you went to The Flagship... did anyone recognize you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190116"
            ]
          },
          "761190116": {
            "id": "761190116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Some did ask, and I said, \"I'm dressing up as the Moon Goddess today. I look just like her, don't I?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190117"
            ]
          },
          "761190117": {
            "id": "761190117",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, you've really taken that trick from Moon-Prayer Night and ran with it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190118"
            ]
          },
          "761190118": {
            "id": "761190118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And they believed you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190119"
            ]
          },
          "761190119": {
            "id": "761190119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Well... Not entirely, but they didn't talk to me afterward either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190120"
            ]
          },
          "761190120": {
            "id": "761190120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Was my acting not natural? I'll keep practicing somewhere else next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190121"
            ]
          },
          "761190121": {
            "id": "761190121",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why does it feel like someone learned all the wrong lessons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190122"
            ]
          },
          "761190122": {
            "id": "761190122",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Luonnotar",
            "text": "!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190123"
            ]
          },
          "761190123": {
            "id": "761190123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Luonnotar would like you to guess where she's hiding. Would you like to play a round?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190124"
            ]
          },
          "761190124": {
            "id": "761190124",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm in!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190125"
            ]
          },
          "761190125": {
            "id": "761190125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "In that case, please stake 100,000 Mora to start with. Those are The Flagship's rules, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761190126"
            ]
          },
          "761190126": {
            "id": "761190126",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, you definitely should've skipped that lesson!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7611905",
